text":" 等值，它们对齐所需要的“标尺”（基线、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x-height"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、内容区顶部）是从哪里来的？它们是由父元素的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"font-size"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"font-family"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性预先定义好的。 浏览器在处理一个元素时，可以立即根据父元素的字体属性，知道它应该对齐的基线在哪里。这个参考线是“静态的”、“预先确定的”。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9bf92a0-28c2-4e4f-8cd1-a530296b33b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"top"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bottom"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它们对齐所需要的“标尺”（行框的顶边和底边）是从哪里来的？它们不是由父元素预先定义好的。 它必须先处理完同一行所有的兄弟元素，找出谁最高、谁最低，从而确定整个行框的最终边界。然后，它才能回过头来，把这个元素的顶部对齐到那个最终计算出来的边界上。这个参考线是“动态的”、“事后确定的”。"}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"1ad5a850-6426-474b-8aa8-e9f14df65411","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7323aec0-6791-46b1-8992-ba8f09998f8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"vertical-align"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只能用于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inline"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"inline-block"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"table-cell"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，不能用于块级元素。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e1584870-6def-41a8-81db-e1e12ebf6a9e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了理解上述表述，我们需要先理解两个概念，行内元素的基线和行框的基线。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87f